<ShortDescription>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>Typography Lab</Text>
</Description>
</ShortDescription>
<LongDescription>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>--- Basic styles ---
Normal text.
&lt;b&gt;Bold text.&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;i&gt;Italic text.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;u&gt;Underlined text.&lt;/u&gt;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Bold italic.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Bold underline.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;Italic underline.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;c&gt;Command / input colour (c).&lt;/c&gt;

--- Alignment ---
&lt;left&gt;Left-aligned paragraph.&lt;/left&gt;
&lt;center&gt;Centered paragraph (center).&lt;/center&gt;
&lt;centre&gt;Centred paragraph (centre).&lt;/centre&gt;
&lt;right&gt;Right-aligned paragraph.&lt;/right&gt;

--- Font faces ---
&lt;font face="Arial"&gt;Arial face.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font face="Times New Roman"&gt;Times New Roman face.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font face="Courier New"&gt;Courier New face.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font face="Comic Sans MS"&gt;Comic Sans MS face.&lt;/font&gt;

--- Font sizes ---
&lt;font size=10&gt;Absolute size 10.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font size=14&gt;Absolute size 14.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font size=18&gt;Absolute size 18.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font size=+2&gt;Relative size +2.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font size=-1&gt;Relative size -1.&lt;/font&gt;

--- Named colours ---
&lt;font color="red"&gt;red&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="blue"&gt;blue&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="green"&gt;green&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="purple"&gt;purple&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="orange"&gt;orange&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="teal"&gt;teal&lt;/font&gt;

--- Hex colours ---
&lt;font color="#ff0000"&gt;#ff0000&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="#00aa00"&gt;#00aa00&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="#0066cc"&gt;#0066cc&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color="ff00ff"&gt;ff00ff (no hash)&lt;/font&gt;

--- Combined ---
&lt;font face="Comic Sans MS" size=+2 color="purple"&gt;Comic Sans, larger, purple.&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font face="Arial" color="yellow"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Arial bold yellow (bold inside font).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face="Courier New" color="cyan"&gt;Courier New bold cyan (font inside bold).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;center&gt;&lt;font face="Times New Roman" size=16 color="maroon"&gt;&lt;i&gt;Centered Times italic maroon.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/center&gt;

--- Line break ---
Before br.&lt;br&gt;After br (should be on the next line).

Type demo to reprint this sample.</Text>
</Description>
</LongDescription>
